{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model with avgpool aggregation, achieving 0.5907 validation accuracy (vs. 0.4849 for singleprofile baseline). The result suggests multiprofile settings may improve RNA-only performance, but the role of aggregation and other factors remains uncertain. The validation F1 of 0.5727 supports the accuracy improvement, though no direct comparison to multimodal multiprofile configurations exists."
}

